}], "slug": "bag-of-dreams", "storyline": "Draw dream fragments from your bag and transform your Dream Space into a peaceful, safe vessel to carry you into the next night... Just make sure you watch out for the night terrors and other dangers, of course!\n\nWith a near-endlessly replayable core loop, hundreds of synergies and plenty of nightmares to keep you in check, Bag of Dreams offers a refreshing take on immersive deckbuilding with tons of heart and a cosy, welcoming art style to match.\n\nWill you build cautiously, or gamble everything to craft the perfect dream?", "summary": "Bag of dreams is the cozy card-based Roguelike Dreambuilder you didn't know you needed. Can you piece together the perfect sleep, one fragment at a time?", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/bag-of-dreams"}